et, ligne claire"], "inputs": [{"name": "image", "link": 523, "label": "image", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image"}, {"widget": {"name": "model"}, "name": "model", "label": "model", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "model"}, {"widget": {"name": "threshold"}, "name": "threshold", "label": "threshold", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "threshold"}, {"widget": {"name": "character_threshold"}, "name": "character_threshold", "label": "character_threshold", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "character_threshold"}, {"widget": {"name": "replace_underscore"}, "name": "replace_underscore", "label": "replace_underscore", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "replace_underscore"}, {"widget": {"name": "trailing_comma"}, "name": "trailing_comma", "label": "trailing_comma", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "trailing_comma"}, {"widget": {"name": "exclude_tags"}, "name": "exclude_tags", "label": "exclude_tags", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "exclude_tags"}], "flags": {"collapsed": false}, "type": "WD14Tagger|pysssss", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#3f5159", "size": [358.1336669921875, 220], "pos": [-2500.29296875, 1206.6573486328125], "id": 333, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "WD14Tagger|pysssss"}, "order": 9}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "output", "links": [397], "label": "output", "type": "*", "localized_name": "output"}], "size": [386.19482421875, 331.8851318359375], "pos": [-343.30047607421875, 691.3109130859375], "widgets_values": ["一位年轻女性站在城市巷弄中，微风拂动她及肩的棕色长发，发丝轻扬，自然蓬松，额前刘海随风轻扬，眼神清澈温柔，略带沉思，直视镜头，嘴唇微启，似在无声诉说。她身着一件洗旧做旧的深蓝色牛仔夹克，夹克上有自然磨损与斑驳痕迹，内搭白色圆领T恤，领口露出灰色连帽卫衣的帽沿，袖口与下摆处可见卫衣的柔软绒布，层次感丰富。夹克纽扣整齐排列，胸前口袋与缝线细节清晰，衣摆自然垂落，双手自然垂于身侧，姿态放松而随性。\n\n前景聚焦于人物上半身，构图采用中近景，人物占据画面约三分之二，略微偏左，留出右侧空间展现巷道延伸感。背景是略显斑驳的城市街巷，两侧老旧建筑墙面有岁月痕迹，窗户与阳台错落，电线杆与杂乱电线横跨天空，远处建筑轮廓模糊，营造出纵深与真实感。巷道地面为石板路，部分区域有光影斑驳，增添生活气息。\n\n画面采用自然光，光线柔和，从左上方斜射，照亮人物面部与发丝，形成微妙的明暗对比，鼻梁与颧骨处有柔和高光，阴影部分过渡自然。背景光线稍暗，形成明暗对比，突出主体。整体色调偏冷暖平衡，牛仔蓝与白色形成清新对比，灰色卫衣帽沿与建筑灰调相呼应，营造出日常又略带文艺的氛围。\n\n视觉引导从人物面部眼神自然引向其发丝飘动与衣摆细节，再延伸至背景巷道，引导观众视线在主体与环境间流动。整体氛围宁静、自然、略带都市孤独感，仿佛是午后闲适漫步的瞬间，充满生活气息与艺术感。画面如用普通相机在街巷中抓拍，保留真实质感与生活细节，无过度修图痕迹，呈现自然、真实、富有故事性的影像风格。"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "anything", "link": 395, "label": "anything", "type": "*", "localized_name": "anything"}], "flags": {"collapsed": true}, "id": 258, "type": "easy showAnything", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfyui-easy-use", "ver": "125b3a4905ac9367f7aae5c2df67e2282f0a3d37", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.4.1"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "easy showAnything"}, "order": 22}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "STRING", "links": [395], "label": "STRING", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "STRING"}], "size": [369.8070373535156, 421.6905517578125], "pos": [-555.9928588867188, 666.4093017578125], "widgets_values": ["你是一位专业的AI图像生成提示词工程师。请详细描述这张图像主体、前景、中景、背景、构图、视觉引导、光影氛围等细节并创作出具有深度、氛围和艺术感或日常业余设备拍摄的图像提示词。\n\n要求：中文提示词，不用出现对图像水印的描述，不要出现无关的文字和符号，不需要总结，限制在800字以内", "Qwen3-VL-8B-Instruct", "none", false, 0.7, 2048, 200704, 1003520, 1393, "randomize", "eager"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "source_path", "label": "source_path", "type": "PATH", "localized_name": "source_path"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image", "link": 542, "label": "image", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image"}, {"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}, {"widget": {"name": "model"}, "name": "model", "label": "model", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "model"}, {"widget": {"name": "quantization"}, "name": "quantization", "label": "quantization", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "quantization"}, {"widget": {"name": "keep_model_loaded"}, "name": "keep_model_loaded", "label": "keep_model_loaded", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "keep_model_loaded"}, {"widget": {"name": "temperature"}, "name": "temperature", "label": "temperature", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "temperature"}, {"widget": {"name": "max_new_token